; vm.5ba — the 5bit token walker, WRITTEN IN 5BIT
; Compiled by compiler.5b to native x86-64.
; Reads a .5b file from slots, walks tokens on a value stack, computes result.
; This REPLACES the 259-byte hand-written hex VM — it IS the VM.
;
; Grid layout:
;   PROG_N=10: token count in program
;   PROG_BASE=100: program tokens
;   VSP=50: value stack pointer (index into VSTACK)
;   VSTACK_BASE=200: value stack (each slot = one int64)
;   IP=51: instruction pointer
;   RESULT=52: EMIT output

